# The Star Forge (K1, sta_m45aa deck one, sta_m45ab deck two, sta_m45ac
# the command centre, sta_m45ad the viewing platform), the light side's
# way: the Jedi at the landing, the decks fought through, Bastila brought
# back to the light (her Battle Meditation turned on the Sith fleet), the
# six droid generators shut down, Malak fought while he drains the captive
# Jedi until he falls; the Star Forge destroyed, the ceremony, the end.
# Starts from the Unknown World route's checkpoint (aboard, at the Forge):
#   kjk playthrough k1 @star_forge data/routes/k1/star_forge.route --god
exit ebn12_ebonexit      # down the ramp: the Jedi there, the dark Jedi
talk
fight 30
save sf_landed
exit sta45a_west_45b     # deck one: droids, troopers, dark Jedi
save sf_deck2
fight 40                 # deck two's turrets: its door to the command centre
                         # opens only once they are destroyed (the door says so)
use sta45b_medium4       # by the way down: 3 computer spikes
exit sta45b_sta45c       # deck two, to the command centre
save sf_command
use sta45c_medium1       # the lower floor's container: 5 computer spikes
# Bastila: no killing her; the light, the bond, love (Persuades, a
# persuasive build since Korriban's).
say i could never kill you
say you can reject the dark side
say use our bond
say turn to the jedi code
say look into your heart
say help us defeat the sith
say i trust you enough
say because i love you
say i do love you
say you could use your battle meditation
use k45_door_bast1       # Malak and Bastila, seen from afar
talk
talk                     # Bastila: "I knew you'd come"
while K_PSTA_BASTSAVE=0  # her duel, round by round, each with words
fight 30
talk
end
save sf_bastila
to k45_strt_malak        # Malak at his door: the generators started
talk
save sf_generators
# Each generator's "Disable" costs computer spikes by the slicer's Computer
# Use (k_psta_token: 8 at none, 3 at 20, 2 at 24). The route stands in the
# levelled character's Computer Use, as Manaan's stands in its Persuade: the
# party comes with 15 to 17 (at 20, five took 15 and the sixth was short), so
# 24, the six taking 12.
skill computer=24
use k45_plc_assdroid     # each shut down (Computer Use, spikes)
talk
use k45_plc_mk2droid
talk
use k45_plc_mk4droid
talk
use k45_plc_excharge
talk
use k45_plc_prbdroid
talk
use k45_plc_wardroid
talk
fight 30
exit sta45c_sta45d       # the viewing platform
save sf_malak
to k45_init_malak        # Malak; between bouts he drains a captive Jedi
talk                     # (eight of them) and is fought again
while STA_MALAK_DEAD=0   # (each round a bout; his drains' scenes play
fight 60                 # as they come; the loop reads its global once the
end                      # world has settled, the playthrough's `Settle`)
credits                  # the Forge destroyed, the ceremony, EndGame
